    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Fatigue; temperature to 37.8 °C at home; no rigors or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Clear rhinorrhea and congestion; right-sided throat pain worse with coughing; no new bleeding from the biopsy site</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dry cough; no sputum, hemoptysis, wheeze, or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vomiting or diarrhea; mild nausea only if varenicline is taken without food</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache, dizziness, or weakness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Worried about the staging scan; sleep broken by cough; no low mood</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>7 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

